
//Our philosophy
{
    "about": {
        "title": "Learn about the philosophy behind our studio",
        "text": "The DJB studio is more a gym or a simple training room — it's a space built for personal evolution. Every area is designed to cultivate discipline, resilience, and focus. The environment encourages athletes to confront their limits, channel their energy, and grow with purpose.
        This space embodies respect, progression, and community. Whether you're a beginner or an advanced practitionner, every individual finds a setting that inspires hard work, sharpens the mind, and strengthens the body. The goal isn't only to shape fighters, but to develop stronger, more grounded, and more self-aware human beings."
    }
}

